$ quack --app com.duckduckgo.mobile --list-actions
--- exit 0
--- stdout
com.duckduckgo.mobile 1.0

app.greet
    Say hello.

    name=<string>
        Required. Who to greet.

    times=<int>
        Default: 1. How many times to say hello.

app.params
    Show the parsed value of each param type.

    text=<string>
    count=<int>
    size=<long>
    ratio=<double>
    flag=<boolean>
    theme=<light|dark>
    tag=<string>...
        Default: a, b. Labels to add, which this description explains at enough
        length that help has to wrap it onto a second line.

account.create
    Create the account.

    username=<string>
        Required.

account.delete
    Delete the account.

account.sync
    Sync the account, which takes about 4 seconds.

app.hangup
    Close the connection without a reply.

app.dropout
    Close the connection after an event.

app.garbled
    Reply with a line that is not JSON.

app.teapot
    Fail with an error code the CLI does not know.
--- stderr
--- device
